{"title":"Focus Topic","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span id=\"Focus_Topic_.28Alcumus.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Focus_Topic_(Alcumus)\">Focus Topic (Alcumus)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Focus_Topic&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Focus Topic (Alcumus)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The focus topic is the topic in which you are working on at the moment in AoPS <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Alcumus\" title=\"Alcumus\">Alcumus</a>. It can span from Polygon Angles, to Trig - Unit Circle, to 3D Geometry - Prisms and others.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Options\">Options</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Focus_Topic&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Options\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>There are many options you can focus on. \nIn addition, you can choose to follow the problems from the AoPS books:\n</p>\n<ul><li>Introduction to Algebra</li>\n<li>Introduction to Geometry</li>\n<li>Introduction to Counting and Probability</li>\n<li>Introduction to Number Theory</li>\n<li>Prealgebra</li></ul>\n<p>You can also just let Alcumus choose a topic for you.\n</p><p><i>This article is a stub.  Help us out by <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=Focus_Topic&amp;action=edit\">expanding it</a></span>.</i>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Focus_Topic&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Alcumus\" title=\"Alcumus\">Alcumus</a>\n</p><p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Algebra\" title=\"Algebra\">Algebra</a>\n</p><p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Geometry\" title=\"Geometry\">Geometry</a>\n</p><p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Probability\" title=\"Probability\">Probability</a>\n</p><p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Number_Theory\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Number Theory\">Number Theory</a>\n</p><p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Prealgebra\" title=\"Prealgebra\">Prealgebra</a>\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018084742\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.011 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.016 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 17/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 274/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    5.385      1 Template:Stub\n100.00%    5.385      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:11687:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018084742 and revision id 228165. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}